  "updated_at": "2026-10-29T20:15:26Z",
  "body": "Is there any other related packages that projects embedded in web containers need to bump along with this change in 22.2.5? \n\nI forked a Material example with `^` v22.2 deps and had the same error. I then set them all to their exact versions without `^` and used the CLI 22.2.5 version with this fix. I still have the same problem in Stackblitz: https://stackblitz.com/edit/rsoem61h?file=package.json\n\nThe adev playground still has the same problem too https://angular.dev/playground?templateId=0-hello-world, but I think that just needs to be bumped to 22.2.5 in the CLI: https://github.com/angular/angular/blob/main/adev/package.json",
  "author_association": "NONE",
